    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89290c73ef3a4edbdc06b3a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回想起三年前，\n我第一次在日本观看的比赛\n就是在东京赛场举办的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fd7e16a8091bf07ec26e980459aac9f1affa846e19ce0775f35e37c5f4220b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
