      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多亏有很多人的支持，我才得以达成理想……\n不，是达成超乎理想的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5e67f5fd1ed7571d8c6c688959f4567b2c317592cb48527c30c0caacbac58c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
